    "instructions": "Interpret the available evidence, assumptions and options to answer a question. Distinguish facts, inference and uncertainty; use Research report when collecting sources is the primary deliverable. Use Fields for concise metadata and the titled Rich text objects for detailed content. Required Fields describe expected information; incomplete drafts may be saved. Ask for missing facts when needed; never invent people, dates, references or results. References identify sources and do not grant access. These Fields do not change Workmap execution state.",
